{"3861920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blyte", "steam_appid": 3861920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the test protocol, Subject EVA (yes, that is you).</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is gone (good job, everyone), and you have just booted up in a flooded underwater research station. Your objective? Cross a vast, dried-up desert to reach a colossal white tower on the horizon. Your guide? A high-end flying assistant robot who deeply wishes they had been paired with a smart microwave instead of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blyte is a first-person puzzle exploration adventure that blends a mysterious atmosphere with dark, absurd, and self-aware humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/extras/e5c523d34c7d68d9d187fdd2ad50e7ec.poster.avif?t=1785139352\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/extras/e5c523d34c7d68d9d187fdd2ad50e7ec.webm?t=1785139352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/extras/e5c523d34c7d68d9d187fdd2ad50e7ec.mp4?t=1785139352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles That Roast Your Intellect:</strong> Align lasers, patch steam pipes, and solve environmental puzzles while your companion robot commentates on your lack of progress. Are you slower than a snail on strike?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wacky Crew of Dysfunctional Robots:</strong>- Subject EVA (You): The experimental robot prototype doing its best.- The Guide Robot: Sarcastic, condescending, and operating on a very short fuse.- Dustin: A simple cleaning robot obsessed with finding his lost chrome bolt.- Dustout: His paranoid brother, who is terrified of suspicious-looking cacti and talking shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Flying Wooden Raft:</strong> Repair and pilot a rickety flying wooden boat powered by unstable nuclear thrusters, and defend it from sand-scorpions using a custom sand-cannon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Absurd, Meta Storyline:</strong> Discover the highly improbable cause behind the end of the world, and try to uncover what is actually waiting for you inside that colossal tower dominating the horizon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extremely Honest Loading Tips:</strong> Enjoy immersive loading screen highlights such as untangling Bluetooth earbuds, reticulating splines, or compiling the tears of ragequitting players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If this desert were a battery, we’d be at 1% for three days. Do you have a hidden charger somewhere, Subject EVA, or do you just like to suffer?&quot;<br>                                   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/extras/a972f6f9af2c2966fbf9b0b5ce1f71b3.poster.avif?t=1785139352\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/extras/a972f6f9af2c2966fbf9b0b5ce1f71b3.webm?t=1785139352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/extras/a972f6f9af2c2966fbf9b0b5ce1f71b3.mp4?t=1785139352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the test protocol, Subject EVA (yes, that is you).</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is gone (good job, everyone), and you have just booted up in a flooded underwater research station. Your objective? Cross a vast, dried-up desert to reach a colossal white tower on the horizon. Your guide? A high-end flying assistant robot who deeply wishes they had been paired with a smart microwave instead of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blyte is a first-person puzzle exploration adventure that blends a mysterious atmosphere with dark, absurd, and self-aware humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/extras/e5c523d34c7d68d9d187fdd2ad50e7ec.poster.avif?t=1785139352\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/extras/e5c523d34c7d68d9d187fdd2ad50e7ec.webm?t=1785139352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/extras/e5c523d34c7d68d9d187fdd2ad50e7ec.mp4?t=1785139352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles That Roast Your Intellect:</strong> Align lasers, patch steam pipes, and solve environmental puzzles while your companion robot commentates on your lack of progress. Are you slower than a snail on strike?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wacky Crew of Dysfunctional Robots:</strong>- Subject EVA (You): The experimental robot prototype doing its best.- The Guide Robot: Sarcastic, condescending, and operating on a very short fuse.- Dustin: A simple cleaning robot obsessed with finding his lost chrome bolt.- Dustout: His paranoid brother, who is terrified of suspicious-looking cacti and talking shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Flying Wooden Raft:</strong> Repair and pilot a rickety flying wooden boat powered by unstable nuclear thrusters, and defend it from sand-scorpions using a custom sand-cannon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Absurd, Meta Storyline:</strong> Discover the highly improbable cause behind the end of the world, and try to uncover what is actually waiting for you inside that colossal tower dominating the horizon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extremely Honest Loading Tips:</strong> Enjoy immersive loading screen highlights such as untangling Bluetooth earbuds, reticulating splines, or compiling the tears of ragequitting players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If this desert were a battery, we’d be at 1% for three days. Do you have a hidden charger somewhere, Subject EVA, or do you just like to suffer?&quot;<br>                                   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/extras/a972f6f9af2c2966fbf9b0b5ce1f71b3.poster.avif?t=1785139352\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/extras/a972f6f9af2c2966fbf9b0b5ce1f71b3.webm?t=1785139352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/extras/a972f6f9af2c2966fbf9b0b5ce1f71b3.mp4?t=1785139352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Humanity is gone. Your only companion is a robot that has all the answers. Except when you ask the right questions. Explore a dying planet, unravel the secrets of the past, and discover the truth about the extinction of the human race.", "supported_languages": "French<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "9/10 – Jeux-Hack-Tue<br />\r\n<br />\r\n9/10 – Gameflop<br />\r\n<br />\r\n8/10 – Connard PC<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/843efccbb03fdd5ca